      <p class="sg-desc">Playfair Display for headings, and Inter for body text and labels. Type sizes scale smoothly with the screen, using <code>clamp()</code>.</p>

      <div class="sg-type-sample">
        <div class="label">Display &middot; Playfair Display, 700</div>
