    <div class="sg-section">
      <div class="sg-title">Spacing &amp; layout</div>
      <p class="sg-desc">Spacing follows a rem-based scale, and section padding adjusts to the screen: <code>clamp(4.5rem, 8vw, 7rem)</code>. Maximum content widths are 1200px for wide layouts, 780px for narrow ones, and 68ch for running text.</p>
    </div>

    <div class="sg-section">
      <div class="sg-title">Accessibility</div>
      <p class="sg-desc">Visible gold focus rings, a skip link that appears on focus, clear page landmarks for screen readers, and respect for reduced-motion settings. The <a href="/accessibility/" class="inline-link">accessibility statement</a> has the full detail.</p>
    </div>

  </div>
